{"ref":"BDB, מַלְכָּה","hw":"מַלְכָּה","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכָּה</span></big><sub>35</sub>  <strong>n.f. queen</strong>:—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:9\" href=\"/Esther.1.9\">Est 1:9</a> + 24 times Est.; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.1\">1 K 10:1</a> + 7 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְלָכוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:8\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.8\">Ct 6:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:9\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.9\">9</a>;—<em>queen</em> of Sheba <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.1\">1 K 10:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:10\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.13\">13</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.1\">2 Ch 9:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.12\">12</a>; of Persia, Vashti <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:9\" href=\"/Esther.1.9\">Est 1:9</a> + 7 times <a data-ref=\"Esther 1\" href=\"/Esther.1\">Est 1</a>; Esther <a data-ref=\"Esther 2:22\" href=\"/Esther.2.22\">Est 2:22</a> + 16 times <a data-ref=\"Esther 4-9\" href=\"/Esther.4-9\">Est 4–9</a> (in Esther mostly appos. of n.pr.; it precedes n.pr. <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:12\" href=\"/Esther.1.12\">Est 1:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:15\" href=\"/Esther.1.15\">15</a>; follows n.pr. <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:9\" href=\"/Esther.1.9\">Est 1:9</a> + 17 times); of Isr. queens only pl. and only <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:8\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.8\">Ct 6:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:9\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.9\">9</a> (both ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּילַגְשִׁים</span>). Cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גְּבִירָה\" href=\"/BDB,_גְּבִירָה\", dir=\"rtl\">גְּבִירָה</a>.","next":"BDB, מְלֶ֫כֶת","prev":"BDB, מֶ֫